WEBVTT

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:22.480
<i>I can't… It's not my time to go.</i>

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:29.154
<i>We'll be all right.</i>

00:00:29.237 --> 00:00:32.866
<i>There must be a paradise</i>
<i>waiting for us, somewhere.</i>

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:35.535
<i>No…</i>

00:00:39.622 --> 00:00:41.958
Aria, you can't go!

00:01:08.651 --> 00:01:11.404
<i>Team B, begin infiltration.</i>
<i>Team A, the path is clear.</i>

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:15.325
Hurry up. This is not a drill, Momo.

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:16.409
My apologies.

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:18.203
All right, go!

00:01:18.286 --> 00:01:20.747
Smoke out these vampires
that lurk in the shadows.

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:31.049
Why won't you leave us alone?

00:01:36.888 --> 00:01:37.889
Fire!

00:01:56.491 --> 00:01:57.408
Mirena!

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:18.638
Good work.
I'm sure there are others like him.

00:02:18.721 --> 00:02:20.265
Find and eliminate them.

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:22.308
Thanks.

00:02:22.892 --> 00:02:23.977
Please, I beg you.

00:02:25.603 --> 00:02:27.605
I haven't been bitten.

00:02:27.689 --> 00:02:30.817
Accept your fate here and now,
lest you begin roaming the night

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:32.235
as a bloodsucking vampire.

00:02:35.405 --> 00:02:36.239
Momo…

00:02:37.031 --> 00:02:38.575
-Let's go.
-Yeah.

00:02:42.203 --> 00:02:43.037
Clear!

00:02:44.372 --> 00:02:45.206
Clear!

00:02:52.964 --> 00:02:54.465
Vampires?

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:17.614
Don't move! Put that down.

00:03:27.665 --> 00:03:29.334
Someone might hear that.

00:03:30.418 --> 00:03:31.669
Stop that!

00:03:44.599 --> 00:03:45.433
Momo!

00:04:20.134 --> 00:04:21.594
Why didn't you shoot?

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:24.847
-She was a child.
-Don't give me that crap!

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:28.726
We barely have a fighting chance
once that drug fully takes effect.

00:04:31.145 --> 00:04:33.189
<i>-Reporting. The area has been…</i>
-I'm sorry.

00:04:33.773 --> 00:04:36.693
Good. Gather all resources
and begin heading back.

00:04:37.819 --> 00:04:40.446
Damn. Enough with the annoying chiming.

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:42.156
Sounds like the cries of vampires.

00:04:54.502 --> 00:04:56.170
<i>One winter, long ago…</i>

00:04:58.464 --> 00:05:02.385
<i>vampires suddenly appeared,</i>
<i>bringing with them a plague.</i>

00:05:02.885 --> 00:05:04.053
<i>With the abundance of blood,</i>

00:05:04.137 --> 00:05:06.556
<i>they were able to multiply</i>
<i>at an alarming speed.</i>

00:05:08.933 --> 00:05:14.522
<i>Humankind was no match</i>
<i>for their near-immortal strength.</i>

00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:19.777
<i>Before long, we'd lost most of our land.</i>

00:05:22.071 --> 00:05:26.451
<i>And so, we gathered in a small town</i>
<i>and built a wall of light.</i>

00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:32.206
<i>There, we protected one another in hopes</i>
<i>of increasing our chances of survival.</i>

00:05:34.292 --> 00:05:36.169
<i>Vampires lurk in every shadow.</i>

00:05:36.252 --> 00:05:39.088
<i>In fear of alerting their keen senses,</i>

00:05:40.298 --> 00:05:44.635
<i>music, and any other semblance</i>
<i>of culture as we'd known it,</i>

00:05:44.719 --> 00:05:46.804
<i>have been strictly prohibited.</i>

00:05:54.645 --> 00:05:58.733
<i>Our lives have gone like this,</i>
<i>with no other options in sight.</i>

00:06:39.982 --> 00:06:41.859
<i>Evening operations will begin shortly.</i>

00:06:41.943 --> 00:06:45.071
<i>Crew members should</i>
<i>promptly return to their stations.</i>

00:06:47.115 --> 00:06:49.117
How's the scar on your ear doing?

00:06:49.784 --> 00:06:50.618
It's okay.

00:06:51.119 --> 00:06:52.995
Make sure to disinfect it
when you get home.

00:06:53.079 --> 00:06:55.164
Yeah. Thanks.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:01.587
I know I should be working harder
to fulfill my role.

00:07:03.548 --> 00:07:07.135
You really have a knack
for working with your hands.

00:07:08.761 --> 00:07:10.304
What have you stolen? Show me!

00:07:11.681 --> 00:07:12.557
I'm sorry.

00:07:14.308 --> 00:07:15.309
Momo.

00:07:16.602 --> 00:07:17.437
Here.

00:07:19.021 --> 00:07:20.148
Where did you get that?

00:07:20.731 --> 00:07:22.692
I brought it back. It's my little secret.

00:07:33.286 --> 00:07:35.872
-You can have that, Momo.
-Really?

00:07:35.955 --> 00:07:39.125
Really. Repair it,
because I want to listen to it.

00:07:39.208 --> 00:07:40.334
I will.

00:07:55.141 --> 00:07:57.226
-10687.
-Yes!

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:59.437
The commander in chief wants to see you.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:00.813
Roger that.

00:08:06.611 --> 00:08:08.279
10687 here.

00:08:08.362 --> 00:08:10.615
Reporting as you ordered.

00:08:13.159 --> 00:08:14.202
This is an order.

00:08:14.285 --> 00:08:17.413
You're being reassigned
to work in the chief executive office.

00:08:18.164 --> 00:08:19.874
Starting tomorrow, you'll report there.

00:08:20.583 --> 00:08:23.711
I'm getting the hang of my current role.
I could stay there.

00:08:23.794 --> 00:08:27.590
Waste management is no place
for a graduate of the military academy.

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:31.552
I assigned you a position
in low-ranking labor first,

00:08:31.636 --> 00:08:34.555
because an admin role for a cadet
would've garnered disapproval.

00:08:34.639 --> 00:08:35.973
Do you understand?

00:08:36.974 --> 00:08:41.521
Yes. I will report as ordered
starting tomorrow, Commander.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:45.733
-So--
-I heard, according to rumors,

00:08:45.816 --> 00:08:49.612
that the commander's daughter
hesitated to shoot a vampire.

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:53.991
But that girl, she was a child!

00:08:54.075 --> 00:08:56.744
Was it worth risking
the lives of your comrades?

00:08:57.787 --> 00:08:59.080
Look at this.

00:08:59.163 --> 00:09:01.791
<i>This war drags on</i>
<i>at the hands of these vampires.</i>

00:09:02.291 --> 00:09:04.001
<i>Our city is on the verge of destruction.</i>

00:09:04.794 --> 00:09:08.005
<i>The average life span shortens</i>
<i>as our resources become limited.</i>

00:09:09.048 --> 00:09:12.635
<i>If we don't kill them, they'll kill us.</i>
<i>War is the only option.</i>

00:09:13.928 --> 00:09:15.012
<i>You understand?</i>

00:09:41.581 --> 00:09:42.999
<i>Stop, Fine.</i>

00:09:43.082 --> 00:09:45.334
-I can't go on.
-Nonsense.

00:09:45.418 --> 00:09:47.128
We're just getting started.

00:09:47.712 --> 00:09:50.548
So I guess that's
Lady Fine's current favorite.

00:09:50.631 --> 00:09:53.843
She's fickle.
I'm sure she'll grow bored soon.

00:09:53.926 --> 00:09:57.263
Look at her, ignoring her queenly duties
and dancing the days away.

00:09:57.346 --> 00:09:58.598
Deplorable.

00:10:05.187 --> 00:10:06.314
Fine.

00:10:07.523 --> 00:10:08.608
Oh, no. Oh, my.

00:10:14.405 --> 00:10:17.408
Wait here. I'm stepping out for fresh air.

00:10:19.035 --> 00:10:19.869
Picture-perfect.

00:10:19.952 --> 00:10:21.037
Lady Fine.

00:10:21.537 --> 00:10:23.289
Now, now. Wait your turn.

00:10:46.103 --> 00:10:51.192
I heard that the Warms are planning
to execute a mass invasion soon.

00:10:51.776 --> 00:10:55.321
So we're gathering our forces
and planning a counterattack.

00:10:56.113 --> 00:10:59.825
But our troops are lacking.
We'd like you to fight with us.

00:11:00.993 --> 00:11:04.121
I hadn't seen you for a while
and you want to talk about that?

00:11:06.624 --> 00:11:08.918
We lost allies today
outside of the city.

00:11:09.418 --> 00:11:11.879
We have to defeat
as many Warm soldiers as possible.

00:11:12.546 --> 00:11:14.173
By any means necessary.

00:11:14.715 --> 00:11:16.550
I told you I'm not interested.

00:11:17.551 --> 00:11:20.137
What do you expect to leave behind

00:11:20.638 --> 00:11:23.099
if you destroy
all that is beautiful in this world?

00:11:23.682 --> 00:11:26.394
We didn't start this war. The Warms did.

00:11:27.144 --> 00:11:28.354
It's all the same.

00:11:35.694 --> 00:11:37.655
Stop perusing my things without asking.

00:11:37.738 --> 00:11:39.323
Not an ounce of delicacy in you.

00:11:41.951 --> 00:11:44.537
I assume you're still not drinking blood.

00:11:45.663 --> 00:11:48.040
How long do you think
you can dance around the issue?

00:11:48.124 --> 00:11:50.793
-It's none of your business.
-It absolutely is!

00:11:51.502 --> 00:11:56.006
-You're in my care--
<i>-Fine, are you done with your break?</i>

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:58.717
Drink this.

00:11:59.802 --> 00:12:04.723
Even you won't be able to keep it together
without having blood.

00:12:07.852 --> 00:12:09.353
What I want, Fine,

00:12:10.396 --> 00:12:12.273
is for you to be yourself again.

00:12:13.107 --> 00:12:14.316
The real you.

00:12:46.265 --> 00:12:47.725
That's all for now.

00:12:49.185 --> 00:12:52.062
<i>It's so touching.</i>

00:12:52.813 --> 00:12:53.647
Yeah.

00:13:13.083 --> 00:13:16.420
We've located a vampire lair
in the northern mountains.

00:13:16.504 --> 00:13:18.506
Troop E has been dispatched to the area.

00:13:19.089 --> 00:13:21.425
That seems a bit hasty, don't you think?

00:13:21.509 --> 00:13:24.136
I can't imagine it would succeed.

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:25.513
If I could have your attention.

00:13:26.472 --> 00:13:29.099
This is the drug
that's been popular among them.

00:13:30.142 --> 00:13:33.145
<i>It enhances their physical abilities</i>
<i>at the cost of death.</i>

00:13:33.229 --> 00:13:36.023
It's a means of launching
a suicidal attack.

00:13:36.106 --> 00:13:40.069
<i>Using this method, nearly 100 of them</i>
<i>have sacrificed their lives.</i>

00:13:40.152 --> 00:13:45.366
<i>It goes to show that they're desperate</i>
<i>enough to use such extreme tactics.</i>

00:13:47.243 --> 00:13:50.829
We should invade their nest swiftly
and settle this once and for all.

00:13:57.253 --> 00:14:00.881
I heard that you promoted your daughter
to an admin role.

00:14:00.965 --> 00:14:04.426
Apparently, she graduated
military training with flying colors.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:07.388
You must be proud to have
a child like that. I'm envious.

00:14:11.225 --> 00:14:13.269
No need for flattery, Deputy Commander.

00:14:13.352 --> 00:14:16.397
More importantly,
I hear you're working on a plan

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:19.316
<i>to neutralize the vampires</i>
<i>with a newly designed weapon.</i>

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:22.194
I admire your efforts
to gain extra credit.

00:14:22.278 --> 00:14:25.322
However, it's my job to eliminate them.

00:14:25.406 --> 00:14:27.324
Stay in your lane and follow my lead.

00:14:32.705 --> 00:14:34.206
Thank you for your hard work.

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:35.583
Drop the formalities.

00:14:36.333 --> 00:14:38.294
Finish up your work and go home.

00:14:45.926 --> 00:14:48.846
I heard you had your work
cut out for you yesterday.

00:14:48.929 --> 00:14:52.474
There was an unexpected run-in
with an enemy defense force in Area B.

00:14:53.058 --> 00:14:55.477
-We lost four people.
-I see.

00:14:59.148 --> 00:15:00.941
How's your new job?

00:15:01.609 --> 00:15:02.443
Yeah…

00:15:03.527 --> 00:15:05.571
The work is interesting.

00:15:06.155 --> 00:15:07.823
I know I'm lucky.

00:15:09.158 --> 00:15:12.912
Sounds nice. I wish I could just
stamp papers all day.

00:15:15.915 --> 00:15:19.084
I'm sorry. Please stop!
Come on. I'm sorry!

00:15:19.168 --> 00:15:21.086
Okay. No more snowballs!

00:15:27.343 --> 00:15:30.304
Momo! Momo, are you okay?

00:15:43.817 --> 00:15:47.196
I think the music box is all fixed.
I'll bring it tomorrow.

00:15:47.696 --> 00:15:49.323
I want to listen to it with you.

00:15:49.406 --> 00:15:52.284
-Sweet. Promise we will.
-Yeah.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.166
I've been waiting, Fine.

00:15:59.792 --> 00:16:01.877
I'm not here to help you.

00:16:02.586 --> 00:16:04.004
Then why did you come?

00:16:04.797 --> 00:16:06.548
I'm searching for a place to die.

00:16:07.675 --> 00:16:10.928
-The queen is back.
-Incredible. Fine is here with us!

00:16:11.011 --> 00:16:14.139
She understood our struggle
and stood up to the challenge!

00:16:14.223 --> 00:16:15.933
You're their biggest star.

00:16:23.983 --> 00:16:26.777
This is too slow!
We were meant to be there by noon.

00:16:27.277 --> 00:16:32.116
My sincere apologies. All teams
and engineers are now in position.

00:16:32.199 --> 00:16:34.743
<i>-Finish the mission, now.</i>
-Understood.

00:16:35.327 --> 00:16:36.620
<i>All right. Open them, now!</i>

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.207
Teams B and C, move out.

00:16:40.749 --> 00:16:42.876
<i>Go, go, go!</i>

00:16:43.419 --> 00:16:45.587
<i>Destroy all of their blockades!</i>

00:17:03.439 --> 00:17:05.941
-Stop singing!
-Mama, why?

00:17:06.525 --> 00:17:08.819
Did you think I wouldn't find out?

00:17:08.902 --> 00:17:10.487
This is their culture.

00:17:10.571 --> 00:17:13.824
You of all people should understand
how dire our existence is

00:17:13.907 --> 00:17:15.242
and that it's their fault!

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:18.871
I'm sorry.

00:17:18.954 --> 00:17:20.789
Are you so unfulfilled that you'd defy me?

00:17:20.873 --> 00:17:23.292
-I'm sorry.
-I feed you plenty.

00:17:23.375 --> 00:17:25.377
And provide proper work for you.

00:17:25.461 --> 00:17:28.380
Tell me, what more could you want?

00:17:38.223 --> 00:17:41.477
You think I like living like this?

00:17:42.186 --> 00:17:45.105
I do all of this for you.

00:17:48.317 --> 00:17:50.152
Please stop sobbing.

00:17:53.155 --> 00:17:54.031
Momo.

00:17:54.823 --> 00:17:56.617
There, there. Come to me.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.251
Come here, Momo.

00:18:09.797 --> 00:18:14.176
I can't stand to see you be sad.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:26.313
Where are you going, Momo?

00:18:26.396 --> 00:18:27.731
You're weak!

00:18:28.899 --> 00:18:31.819
You think you'll be able to survive

00:18:31.902 --> 00:18:34.196
if you don't follow
the rules of this society?

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:41.787
<i>We've been outsmarted.</i>
<i>Their lair is nowhere to be found.</i>

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:45.541
<i>Area B has been hit with bombs.</i>
<i>We're in the crossfire, Commander!</i>

00:18:47.251 --> 00:18:48.293
I'll be right there.

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:53.590
It's time. Tonight, we avenge our family,
once and for all.

00:18:54.174 --> 00:18:56.802
We'll destroy that wretched tower of light

00:18:56.885 --> 00:18:59.054
and massacre humankind!

00:19:04.935 --> 00:19:07.229
Get them! Kill the vampires!

00:19:07.312 --> 00:19:08.981
Show them what our elite force can do!

00:19:09.064 --> 00:19:11.316
I hate this, Mirena.

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:13.735
I just want to leave this place.

00:19:14.403 --> 00:19:15.237
Momo.

00:19:16.488 --> 00:19:18.365
This is the only home we have.

00:19:18.448 --> 00:19:21.493
Stay here with me.
Let's grow old together.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:25.998
Momo, do you hear me?

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:27.958
Momo? Momo.

00:20:15.797 --> 00:20:18.258
-What's the situation?
-Our defenses are under attack.

00:20:18.342 --> 00:20:20.385
It's unclear
how many vampires are present.

00:20:20.469 --> 00:20:24.097
As long as there's light on our perimeter,
we can take them down easily.

00:20:24.181 --> 00:20:26.642
Stay on alert.
This attack is unlike any other.

00:20:26.725 --> 00:20:28.727
We can't be sure what tactics they'll use.

00:20:31.813 --> 00:20:34.691
Just a little more.
Soon that tower will be rubble.

00:20:35.943 --> 00:20:37.611
Fine, are you all right?

00:20:37.694 --> 00:20:39.488
It's just a bit bright for me.

00:20:40.030 --> 00:20:42.324
Stay by my side. I'm worried about you.

00:20:42.407 --> 00:20:43.325
No thanks.

00:20:48.163 --> 00:20:51.291
They'll try to come through Area B
in order to avoid the light.

00:20:51.959 --> 00:20:53.919
Gather our troops
at the forest's entrance.

00:20:54.002 --> 00:20:56.421
We'll burn them to dust using light.

00:20:56.922 --> 00:20:59.383
-Where are you headed?
-I'm of no use up here.

00:20:59.466 --> 00:21:01.176
I'll be giving orders on the ground.

00:21:08.183 --> 00:21:09.935
Their power hasn't shut down yet?

00:21:35.252 --> 00:21:36.253
Help me.

00:21:38.255 --> 00:21:40.841
You kill our soldiers
and still ask for mercy?

00:21:40.924 --> 00:21:42.926
Give that here. I'll do it.

00:21:47.681 --> 00:21:48.515
Stop!

00:22:03.071 --> 00:22:03.905
Damn it!

00:22:07.909 --> 00:22:10.579
You don't deserve to see me die.

00:22:10.662 --> 00:22:13.248
Your destiny ends here.

00:22:13.832 --> 00:22:15.083
It can't be.

00:22:19.546 --> 00:22:21.923
<i>No. I can't leave.</i>

00:22:22.507 --> 00:22:24.676
<i>I have to stay here.</i>

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:25.886
<i>Please,</i>

00:22:27.179 --> 00:22:30.432
<i>stop this song.</i>

00:23:16.061 --> 00:23:19.147
I don't want to do this anymore.

00:23:21.024 --> 00:23:22.651
This world…

00:23:23.485 --> 00:23:25.195
Take me away from here

00:23:26.071 --> 00:23:27.989
to some place where I can be alone.

00:23:28.573 --> 00:23:31.493
It's all too much to bear.

00:23:40.127 --> 00:23:42.671
A vampire! Don't come near me!

00:23:43.880 --> 00:23:46.049
Who are you?

00:23:46.133 --> 00:23:49.094
-Don't touch me! Let go!
-How do you know that song?

00:23:49.177 --> 00:23:51.179
I have nothing to say to a vampire!

00:23:52.055 --> 00:23:54.391
Please, let me hear you sing it.

00:23:54.474 --> 00:23:56.268
Just once more!

00:23:57.018 --> 00:23:57.936
Momo!

00:23:59.020 --> 00:24:00.188
Duck!

00:24:07.154 --> 00:24:08.113
Mirena!

00:24:26.840 --> 00:24:27.841
Mirena?

00:24:28.884 --> 00:24:30.260
Where are you?

00:24:32.512 --> 00:24:33.805
Mirena!

00:24:34.306 --> 00:24:35.182
Momo!

00:24:39.769 --> 00:24:40.937
Crap.

00:25:00.248 --> 00:25:02.042
It can't be… Mirena!

00:25:06.338 --> 00:25:07.297
I'm sorry.

00:25:08.089 --> 00:25:09.799
Hang in there! Mirena!

00:25:10.675 --> 00:25:14.095
I won't be able to listen
to the music box.

00:25:14.638 --> 00:25:18.934
No, you can't say that! Mirena!

00:25:20.852 --> 00:25:23.813
It can't be. Mirena!

00:25:41.539 --> 00:25:44.542
-Stop. You won't make it.
-Shut up! Let go!

00:26:03.270 --> 00:26:04.437
Mirena!

00:26:20.412 --> 00:26:21.496
Mirena.

00:26:22.998 --> 00:26:25.083
Here. Come with me.

00:26:26.167 --> 00:26:29.337
No way. Why should I listen to you?

00:26:29.921 --> 00:26:32.465
Listen carefully.
If you stay here, you'll die.

00:26:33.049 --> 00:26:35.302
That monster will devour you.

00:26:39.597 --> 00:26:43.101
We can't hold that thing back
with standard bullets or light.

00:26:43.184 --> 00:26:47.188
Call for backup. Destroy that thing
before it has a chance to get back up.

00:26:48.440 --> 00:26:50.483
Momo! Why are you here?

00:26:51.151 --> 00:26:51.985
Mama?

00:26:52.068 --> 00:26:55.071
At this range,
your daughter is in the line of fire.

00:26:55.155 --> 00:26:56.364
How would you like to proceed?

00:26:58.241 --> 00:27:00.869
Extermination is our priority.
If it moves, shoot.

00:27:02.787 --> 00:27:04.247
I heard you back in the forest.

00:27:04.831 --> 00:27:06.458
You said you want to escape this place.

00:27:06.958 --> 00:27:08.418
This war will never be over.

00:27:08.501 --> 00:27:12.672
Eventually all logic will be lost
and everyone will become monsters.

00:27:13.465 --> 00:27:17.844
Do you wish to stay here
and live as though you're already dead?

00:27:19.054 --> 00:27:21.765
If not, then come with me.

00:27:31.107 --> 00:27:32.150
Wait.

00:27:35.320 --> 00:27:36.237
Wait!

00:27:38.573 --> 00:27:39.616
We've lost power.

00:27:40.200 --> 00:27:41.493
We need backup!

00:27:42.994 --> 00:27:45.038
I did it!

00:27:45.121 --> 00:27:47.874
Now I'll finally be a vampire!

00:27:50.001 --> 00:27:53.254
Good. The Warm traitors
have done their part.

00:27:53.838 --> 00:27:57.717
It's time, Koki. Let's go!
Destroy the tower.

00:28:17.570 --> 00:28:18.947
Damn it. They're reckless.

00:28:20.490 --> 00:28:21.574
Mama.

00:29:15.754 --> 00:29:17.380
The light. Crap.

00:29:18.423 --> 00:29:20.925
Allegro, that's enough.
We should withdraw for now.

00:29:23.303 --> 00:29:24.220
Allegro.

00:29:25.346 --> 00:29:26.473
Retreat!

00:29:33.813 --> 00:29:34.814
Hey, you.

00:29:35.398 --> 00:29:36.691
Are you all right?

00:29:48.620 --> 00:29:53.625
Subtitle translation by: Angie Yaeyama
